  "Commercial use requires contact": "Niuernikkut atorneq attaveqarnissamik piumasaqaraa",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Bletchleymi AI-p isumannaatsuunerata pillugu ataatsimiinnermi kingorna aallartinneqarluni, Yoshua Bengio siulersorlugu nunani 30-nik missiliornerusuni ilisimasalinnik 100-it sinnerlugit ilaqartunik, FN-ip, OECD-p EU-llu ilanngullugit, nalunaarummi namminersortumi ilisimatuussutsikkut uppernarsaatit AI-p siulersuutaasumi piginnaanerinik navianartorsiuteqarnerinillu katersorneqarput — erseqqissarlugu systemit ilaat maannakkut misissorneqarnerannik nassaartisinnaasut aammalu pissuseranik naapertuuttumik allanngortitsisinnaasut.",
