  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Eqqortumik inissisimaneq: namminersortumik ilisimatusarnermi aallaqqaatit, protokollinut siunnersuutit, aammalu ammasumik specifikationimik misileraat.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Siornatigut aalajangersimasoq aaqqinneqarpoq: Belgium (BE) maannakkut hollanditut ilanngunneqarpoq franskitut taarserlugu — flamsk oqaasilerisut nunami amerlanerpaapput (~60%) valonimiut franskisut oqaasilerisunit (~40%) sinnerlugit.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Siornatigut aalajangersimasoq aaqqinneqarpoq: Kazakhstan (KZ) maannakkut kasakhitut ilanngunneqarpoq russitut taarserlugu, kasakhitut nutserneqarsimasoq maannakkut peqarmat — Belgium-imut siornatigut aaqqinneq assigalugu.",
