  "Not legal advice, and not a definition of AGI legal personhood": "Inatsisitigut siunnersuuteqarani, aammalu AGI-p inatsisitigut inuttuunera aalajangersaanani",
  "One rejected candidate along the way (a PhilArchive paper that returned a 403 on every fetch attempt) — dropped rather than included on trust.": "Aqqutissami akuerinngisaannaavigineqartoq ataaseq (PhilArchive-imi allaaserisaq, iserfigineqarnissaminut misileraat tamaasa 403-mik akissuteqartoq) — upperisamik ilanngutinngitsigulluunniit peersimavoq.",
