  "Outbound links on /topics now show the full destination URL next to \"Read the source,\" and confirm with a dialog before opening it — so you know exactly which site you are about to visit before you click, not just after.": "/topics-imi allaqqasunut allanut attaviit maannakkut anguffiannik URL tamakkiisumik takutissapput \"Aallaqqaataa atuakkit\"-p sanianiittumik, ammaneqarnissaata siornagulu apeqqutigineqarumaarpoq — taamaalilluni qanoq ittumik nittartakkamik takussasoraluaruit qassiuk siornagit paasilluarumaarpat, kingorna kisiat paasinagu.",
  "Output": "Saqqummiussat",
  "Pagination": "Qupperneq Immikkoortitsineq",
  "Pagination on /topics: 9 entries per page by default, with a setting to switch to 12 or 15 (remembered across visits). Paging composes correctly with search — filtering recalculates pages and jumps back to page 1.": "/topics-imi qupperneq immikkoortitsineq: naliginnaasumik qupperni ataatsimi ilaanngussat qulingiluat, aalajangersakkanik allanngortinneqarsinnaasumik 12-nut 15-nulluunniit (aqqutigisamik eqqaamaneqartuartoq). Qupperneq immikkoortitsineq ujarnermut eqqorluartumik atavoq — killiliinerup qupperneq nutaamik naatsorsuisarpaa qupperneq siulliullu uterfigalugu.",
  "Paste JSON to validate": "JSON misissorniarlugu ilivipput",
  "Path-specific overrides: the blog is open, the premium research section requires a license for anything beyond reading.": "Aqqutissami immikkuualuttumik taarserneqartut: blogi ammasuuvoq, ilisimatusarnermi immikkoortoq akeqartoq akuersissuteqarnissamik piumasaqaraa atuarnermit annerusumut.",
